---
import ConsoleLayout from '../layouts/ConsoleLayout.astro';
import { datasetLastVerified } from '../data/tools';
import { siteUrl } from '../lib/urls';
---
<ConsoleLayout title="About · Performance Testing Tools">
  <main class="about-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs mono"><a href={siteUrl()}>← Directory</a><span>/</span><strong>About</strong></nav>
    <header><p class="eyebrow">FIELD NOTES / QAINSIGHTS</p><h1>A living map of performance tools.</h1><p class="lead">Load Profile Console is a dense, practical directory for engineers choosing tools for load, stress, protocol, and performance testing.</p></header>
    <div class="about-grid"><article class="panel about-card"><h2>How to read the console</h2><p>The original PerformanceTestingTools diagram used a legend to call out the author's personal picks and generally recommended tools. This directory keeps that signal visible: <b class="amber">♥ personal pick</b> marks a personal recommendation, while <b class="cyan">✓ general pick</b> marks a broadly useful choice.</p><p>Mini load profiles are deterministic visual fingerprints, not measured benchmarks. They are generated from each tool's catalog attributes so the same tool always renders the same shape.</p></article><article class="panel about-card"><h2>Maintained with evidence</h2><p>Tool records include official links, ownership, licensing, deployment, protocols, and lifecycle status where available. Renamed and discontinued products remain visible so historical references are not silently lost.</p><p class="mono small">Last shared verification: {datasetLastVerified}</p></article></div>
    <section class="submit panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEE SOMETHING MISSING?</p><h2>Submit a tool or correction</h2></div><a class="button button--amber" href="https://github.com/QAInsights/Performance-Testing-Tools/issues/new?title=Tool%20submission%3A%20&body=Tool%20name%3A%20%0AOfficial%20URL%3A%20%0AWhat%20should%20be%20added%20or%20corrected%3F%20%0A" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open GitHub issue ↗</a></section>
    <footer class="about-footer"><a href="https://qainsights.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">QAInsights ↗</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@qainisghts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YouTube ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/QAInsights/Performance-Testing-Tools" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Source repository ↗</a></footer>
  </main>
</ConsoleLayout>
<style>
  .about-page{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:38px 24px 70px}.breadcrumbs{display:flex;gap:10px;color:var(--color-surface-300);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:55px}.breadcrumbs a{color:var(--color-teal-300)}.about-page h1{max-width:780px;font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,90px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:0}.lead{max-width:700px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-surface-300)}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:60px}.about-card{padding:25px;color:var(--color-surface-300);line-height:1.65}.about-card h2,.submit h2{color:var(--color-surface-100);font-size:20px;margin-top:0}.amber{color:var(--color-amber-400)}.cyan{color:var(--color-cyan-500)}.small{font-size:11px;color:var(--color-teal-300)}.submit{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;padding:20px 25px}.submit h2{margin-bottom:0}.button{display:inline-block;border:1px solid;padding:10px 13px;text-decoration:none}.button--amber{border-color:var(--color-amber-400);background:var(--color-amber-400);color:var(--color-ink)}.about-footer{display:flex;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-teal-700);margin-top:60px;padding-top:18px;font:11px var(--font-mono)}.about-footer a{color:var(--color-teal-300)}@media(max-width:650px){.about-page{padding:25px 14px}.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:35px}.submit{display:block}.submit .button{margin-top:15px}.about-footer{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
